        "description": "Contest location advantage for the focal group. Derived from each group's distance to the center of its own home range: loc_diff = dist_other - dist_focal. Positive values mean the focal group is relatively closer to its home-range center (a 'home advantage'). We include a z-scored continuous version and a binary indicator for focal home advantage.",
        "columns": [
